{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36891","headline":"送王使君赴苏台 · 罗隐","name":"送王使君赴苏台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东南一望可长吁，犹忆王孙领虎符。\n两地干戈连越绝，数年麋鹿卧姑苏。\n疲甿赋重全家尽，旧族兵侵太半无。\n料得伍员兼旅寓，不妨招取好揶揄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36891.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36891","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}